              "text" : "The user is asking for 23 times 17. This is actually the same as 17 times 23 due to the commutative property of multiplication. So the answer should be 391 as well.\n\nBut let me show the calculation to demonstrate:\n\n23 × 17 = 23 × (10 + 7)\n= 23 × 10 + 23 × 7\n= 230 + 161\n= 391\n\nOr I could break it down differently:\n23 × 17 = (20 + 3) × 17\n= 20 × 17 + 3 × 17\n= 340 + 51\n= 391\n\nEither way, it's 391, same as before.",
